      ],
      "name": "Worker",
      "identifier": "worker",
      "description": "Background worker that consumes the \"thumbnails\" and \"exports\" queues from Redis and runs the matching job.",
      "summary": "thumbnails · COCO export",
      "tag": "CONTAINER · RQ WORKER",
      "level": 2,
      "note": [
        "Talks to PostgreSQL and MinIO directly through worker/clients.py; it never calls the API.",
        "No retry or failure queue is configured in the code."
